    "detailed_description": "Not enough friends to play? Join our LFG Discord group!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083450/extras/45a6496f0843202b6d1aeca12491ed3d.poster.avif?t=1669121505\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083450/extras/45a6496f0843202b6d1aeca12491ed3d.webm?t=1669121505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083450/extras/45a6496f0843202b6d1aeca12491ed3d.mp4?t=1669121505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Brawl it out in a Super Casual Ultimate Fight Fest (Extra Deluxe) [SCUFFED], where up to 6 players can fight for the top by customizing their loadouts with more than 20 skill-altering passives! The player with the most points at the end of 6 rounds wins!<br><br><strong><u>Features</u></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Up to 6 players online</li><li>4 different classes</li><li>Various game changing passives</li><li>3 different Arenas</li></ul><br>Choose from 4 unique classes, each fitted with 2 skills.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083450/extras/0e296c230c0c94d1471ba22f01ae923a.poster.avif?t=1669121505\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083450/extras/0e296c230c0c94d1471ba22f01ae923a.webm?t=1669121505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083450/extras/0e296c230c0c94d1471ba22f01ae923a.mp4?t=1669121505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Customize abilities after each round.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083450/extras/1795656559d495a195066931b65f34d0.poster.avif?t=1669121505\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083450/extras/1795656559d495a195066931b65f34d0.webm?t=1669121505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083450/extras/1795656559d495a195066931b65f34d0.mp4?t=1669121505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Pick from a variety of passives as well as one game altering passive every game!!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083450/extras/c398dd2ba7e5eb3be8ecbeb6df72548d.poster.avif?t=1669121505\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083450/extras/c398dd2ba7e5eb3be8ecbeb6df72548d.webm?t=1669121505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083450/extras/c398dd2ba7e5eb3be8ecbeb6df72548d.mp4?t=1669121505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>And a big thank you to these awesome people that helped us playtest the game</strong><br><i>Cavan Low<br>Nabilah Nazmi<br>Calvin Seah<br>Samuel Chen<br>Quek Ming Kang<br>Soh Rui Ming<br>Shaun Ng<br>Aaron Chu<br>Ashraf Azhar<br>Tan Cheng Ying<br>Aqil Hilmi<br>Ho Heng Wan<br>Justin<br>Simon Maximilian Gay<br>Tan Yun Yang<br>Louis Choo<br>Koh Jia Ming<br>Ivan Ho<br>Joseph Cheng<br>Tan Heng Chee<br>Lee Wei Da<br>Dave Kang<br>Samuel Soh<br>Amir<br>Janus<br>Gohan<br>Terence<br>Oh Jun Yang<br>Jeryl goh<br>Darren Tey<br>Jasper Lim<br>Yeo Chong Ye<br>Jonathan Yap<br>Nathaniel<br>Chong Wei Xiang<br>Keith Goh<br>Samuel Lum</i>",
